<title>SWITZERLAND: Italian CPI, BoP heading in right direction - Fazio.</title>
<headline>Italian CPI, BoP heading in right direction - Fazio.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Italy governor Antonio Fazio said Italy's exchange rates, inflation and balance of payments were heading in the right direction.</p>
<p>&quot;The markets are performing quite well, exchange rates, balance of payments and inflation seem to be going in the right direction,&quot; he told reporters after a meeting of G10 central bank governors.</p>
<p>&quot;There's some sign of economic recovery in Europe,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
